<h2><span style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;color:red'>To all
Our Travel Partners<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span
style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></u></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'>This
is to inform all concerned that <b>from 1<sup>st</sup> February 2005 onwards </b>all
cargo connections<b> </b>would be charged in view of the following factors:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ol style='margin-top:0in' start=1 type=1>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;
     tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-family:Verdana'>High demand of
     service request<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;
     tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-family:Verdana'>Last minute visa
     processing request<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;
     tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-family:Verdana'>Security of the
     visa documents &amp; passport <o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;
     tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-family:Verdana'>Pick &amp; drop
     services of the cargo after the office hours and during bad weather
     conditions<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ol>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify'><span
style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify'><span
style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'>Given
below are the rates for the above services inclusive of the Cargo Charges:-<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-indent:
-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .75in'><![if !supportLists]><span
style='font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><![endif]><b><span style='font-family:Verdana'>Cargo Pick-up
@<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </span>Rs. 250/- per cargo<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-align:justify;text-indent:
-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .75in'><![if !supportLists]><span
style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><![endif]><b><span style='font-family:Verdana'>Cargo Delivery @
Rs. 450/-per cargo</span></b><span style='font-family:Verdana'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'>Looking
forward to your support for better services.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'>Thanks
and regards<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'><![if !supportEmptyParas]>&nbsp;<![endif]><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h1>Rajan Dua</h1>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-family:Verdana'>Managing
